<div class="modal fade"
     id="hint1"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="hintLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"
            id="hintLabel">操作提示</h5>
        <button type="button"
                class="btn-close"
                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                aria-label="關閉"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        {{>common-notes01}}

        <p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#ifo-search"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="ifo-search">
            對帳單資料 查詢 ▼
          </button>
        </p>
        <div class="collapse mb-3"
             id="ifo-search">
          <div class="card card-body">
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-warning text-dark">1</span> 輸入查詢條件，無輸入資料為全選</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-warning text-dark">2</span>
              </br><b>帳款月份：</b>
              </br>2025年9月輸入"202509"
              </br>2025年12月輸入"202512"...以此類推</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-warning text-dark">3</span> 按下「Enter」或藍色「查詢」鍵，可進行資料篩選與查詢</p>
            <p><span class="fs-6 badge bg-info text-black">注意</span> 查詢資料區間越長，花費時間越久</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {{>common-notes02}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>